    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 22,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hello there! Would you like to play a game of Black Jack?",
      "translation" : "您好！想玩一局21點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What are the rules?",
      "translation" : "遊戲規則是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I want to play.",
      "translation" : "我要玩。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 25,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No thanks.",
      "translation" : "不了，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What would you like to know?",
      "translation" : "您想了解什麼？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The basics.",
      "translation" : "基本規則"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Winning and loosing.",
      "translation" : "勝負判定"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "'Double Down'.",
      "translation" : "“加倍下注”"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ace value.",
      "translation" : "A的點數"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 32,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Nothing.",
      "translation" : "沒什麼"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Black Jack is a card game in which the goal is to get 21, or as",
      "translation" : "21點是一種紙牌遊戲，目標是讓點數達到21點，或儘可能接近21點，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "close to 21 points as possible, without going over 21.",
      "translation" : "但不能超過21點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 40,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Before the game starts, the player must make a bet.  Once the bet",
      "translation" : "遊戲開始前，玩家必須下注。下注後，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "has been made, both the dealer and the player are dealt 2 cards",
      "translation" : "荷官和玩家各發兩張牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "each.  Depending on what cards you have, you can choose to ^5533FF'stay'^000000,",
      "translation" : "根據您手中的牌，可以選擇^5533FF“停牌”^000000，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "or you can choose to ^5533FF'pull'^000000.",
      "translation" : "也可以選擇^5533FF“要牌”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you choose to 'stay', you are telling the dealer that you don't",
      "translation" : "選擇“停牌”時，表示您不需要更多牌了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "need anymore cards.  This allows the dealer to pull if he/she",
      "translation" : "這樣荷官就可以選擇是否要牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "wants to.  In order to stay, you must have ^FF3355at least 13 points^000000. The",
      "translation" : "要停牌，您的點數必須^FF3355至少為13點^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "dealer can only stay when he/she has^FF3355 17 points or more^000000.",
      "translation" : "荷官只有在點數^FF3355達到17點或以上^000000時才能停牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "When you choose to 'pull', you are telling the dealer that you want",
      "translation" : "選擇“要牌”時，表示您想再拿一張牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "another card.  By pulling more cards you can increase your point",
      "translation" : "多要幾張牌可以增加總點數。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "total.  As long has you have ^FF3355less than 21^000000 points you can pull a",
      "translation" : "只要您的點數^FF3355低於21點^000000，您就可以從牌堆中"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "card from the deck.",
      "translation" : "要一張牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are 3 ways to win and loose at Black Jack.",
      "translation" : "21點有3種勝負判定方式。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "1.) At the end of a Black Jack round, if you have more points",
      "translation" : "1.) 一局結束時，如果您的點數比荷官高，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "than the dealer you will win the round.  Conversely if you have",
      "translation" : "您就贏了。反之，如果您的點數比荷官低，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "less points than the dealer you will loose.",
      "translation" : "您就輸了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "2.) If you pull a card that makes your point total go over 21 you",
      "translation" : "2.) 如果您要牌後總點數超過21點，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "will automatically loose the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'bust'^000000.  If",
      "translation" : "您會自動輸掉這一局。這被稱為^5533FF“爆牌”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 70,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "the dealer busts then you will win the round.",
      "translation" : "如果荷官爆牌，您就贏了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 73,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "3.) If you have a point total of 21 with the first 2 cards, you",
      "translation" : "3.) 如果最初兩張牌的總點數為21點，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 74,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "will automatically win the round.  This is called a ^5533FF'Black Jack'^000000",
      "translation" : "您就會自動獲勝。這叫作^5533FF“21點”^000000，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 75,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "and happens when you get an 'Ace' and a '10 valued' card. If the",
      "translation" : "也就是一張A和一張點數為10的牌。如果"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "dealer gets a Black Jack he/she will automatically win the round.",
      "translation" : "荷官拿到21點，荷官就會自動獲勝。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 78,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "4.) Besides winning and loosing, you can tie with the dealer.  If",
      "translation" : "4.) 除了輸贏，也可能與荷官打成平局。如果"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "both you and the dealer have the same point total at the end of a",
      "translation" : "一局結束時雙方點數相同，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 81,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "round, this will result in a tie with no winner and no loss or gain",
      "translation" : "就會平局，誰也不贏也不輸，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "in money.",
      "translation" : "賭注金額不會增加或減少。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 84,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 85,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is called a ^5533FF'push'^000000 with the dealer.  This also",
      "translation" : "這稱為與荷官^5533FF“和局”^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "applies to both you and the dealer having Black Jack at the same",
      "translation" : "如果雙方同時拿到21點，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "time.",
      "translation" : "也同樣算作和局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 'Double Down' option allows you to double your current bet,",
      "translation" : "“加倍下注”可以將當前賭注翻倍，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "but with the drawback that you will only be able to pull one",
      "translation" : "但之後只能再要一張牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "additional card.  This option is only available at the beginning of",
      "translation" : "每局只有剛開始時才能選擇此選項。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "each round.",
      "translation" : "每一局開始時。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "An example of when doubling down is useful, is when",
      "translation" : "比如，最初兩張牌點數合計為11時，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "your first 2 cards give you a point total of 11.  You have a good",
      "translation" : "加倍下注就很有用。您很有機會通過下一張牌"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "chance of getting 21 or 20 with the next card that you draw.  This",
      "translation" : "湊到21點或20點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "would be a good hand to double down on.",
      "translation" : "這種牌面很適合加倍下注。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The 'Ace' card is a unique card in the game of Black Jack because",
      "translation" : "A是21點遊戲中的特殊牌，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "it can have 2 values.  An Ace can be counted as either 11 points,",
      "translation" : "因為它有兩種點數，可以算作11點，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "or just 1 point.  For example if you had an Ace and a 4, that would",
      "translation" : "也可以只算作1點。例如，若您有一張A和一張4，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "give you either 15 or 5 points.",
      "translation" : "總點數就可以是15點或5點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you decided to stay, the Ace would automatically be counted as",
      "translation" : "如果您選擇停牌，A會自動算作"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "11 points to give you 15 points total.",
      "translation" : "11點，使總點數達到15點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 113,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you had decided to pull and received a 9, the ace would",
      "translation" : "如果您選擇要牌並抽到一張9，A會"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "automatically be counted as 1 point to give you a total of 14",
      "translation" : "自動算作1點，使總點數達到14點。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "points.  If the Ace was counted as 11 points, you would have a",
      "translation" : "如果A算作11點，您的總點數就會"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "point total over 21 and would have lost.",
      "translation" : "超過21點並輸掉這一局。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It is because of the flexibility you have with the 'Ace' that makes",
      "translation" : "正因為A的點數可以靈活變化，"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 121,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "it the most powerful card in the game.",
      "translation" : "它才是遊戲中最強的牌。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Feel free to come back anytime",
      "translation" : "歡迎隨時回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Dealer]",
      "translation" : "[荷官]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please place your bets...",
      "translation" : "請下注..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "2z",
      "translation" : "2澤尼"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Black Jack Dealer",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "10z",
      "translation" : "10澤尼"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 133,
